> Hello people.
> 
> I polymorphed my cat and it turned into a wraith. 
> Suppose it dies, and leaves a corpse.
> 
> Will I have any problem if I eat the corpse of my dead pet (wraith)?

No.

The closely related actions with negative effects are:
* Sacrificing a (former) pet. This gives you the aggravate monster 
intrinsic and a -3 alignment adjustment.
* Eating a cat or a dog. This gives you the 'aggravate monster' 
intrinsic unless you are a cave(wo)man or orc.

But since your action doesn't fit into any of these categories, there 
are no special penalties, except that you could feel bad about it 
roleplayingwise and become distracted and have a YASD.

